P'B = \sqrt{40 - 12 \cdot \dfrac{t^2-8}{4}} = \sqrt{40 - 3t^2 + 24} = \sqrt{64 - 3t^2}

所以目标函数：

f(t) = t + \sqrt{64 - 3t^2}, \quad t \in [\sqrt{8-4}, \sqrt{8+4}] = [2, 2\sqrt{3}]

求导：

f'(t) = 1 - \frac{3t}{\sqrt{64-3t^2}} = 0 \Rightarrow \sqrt{64-3t^2} = 3t

\Rightarrow 64-3t^2 = 9t^2 \Rightarrow 12t^2 = 64 \Rightarrow t^2 = \frac{16}{3} \Rightarrow t = \frac{4}{\sqrt{3}}

此时：

f_{\min} = \frac{4}{\sqrt{3}} + \sqrt{64 - 3 \cdot \frac{16}{3}} = \frac{4}{\sqrt{3}} + \sqrt{64 - 16} = \frac{4}{\sqrt{3}} + \sqrt{48} = \frac{4}{\sqrt{3}} + 4\sqrt{3}

= \frac{4}{\sqrt{3}} + \frac{12}{\sqrt{3}} = \frac{16}{\sqrt{3}} = \frac{16\sqrt{3}}{3}

答案：

\boxed{\frac{16\sqrt{3}}{3}}。这是怎么回事，没渲染吗

